{"id": "86327", "name": "אי-שוויון ריבועי – (x−a)(x−b) ≤ 0 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following inequality:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\le 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as <code dir=\"ltr\">5&gt;=x</code> and/or <code dir=\"ltr\">x&lt;=13</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">Solution: [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Factorise the quadratic, find where each factor changes sign, and read off where the product is negative or zero.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Factorising</b><br>To solve the following inequality:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\le 0. \\]</p>we look for two numbers whose product is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> and whose sum is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>: they are <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span>. Factorise to give \\(({{CT:5}})({{CT:6}}) \\le 0.\\) The roots are <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}={{CT:8}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}={{CT:9}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The sign of the product</b><br>The product will be \\(\\le 0 \\mbox{ if }{{CT:10}} \\mbox{ is }\\ge 0 \\mbox{ and }{{CT:11}}\\le0.\\) The other possibility, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:10}}\\le 0\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:11}}\\ge 0\\)</span>, would need <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\le {{CT:8}}\\)</span> and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\ge {{CT:9}}\\)</span> at the same time, which is impossible. A sign table shows the same:<table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px auto\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\(x\\)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\(x &lt; {{CT:8}}\\)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\({{CT:8}}\\)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\({{CT:8}} &lt; x &lt; {{CT:9}}\\)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\({{CT:9}}\\)</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\"><b>\\(x &gt; {{CT:9}}\\)</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:10}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(-\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:11}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(-\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(-\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(-\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(-\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 10px;text-align:center\">\\(+\\)</td></tr></table>The endpoints are included, because there the product equals <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span> and the inequality is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\le\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The answer</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:8}}\\le {{CT:7}}\\le {{CT:9}} \\]</p>This solution can be entered as \\({{CT:7}}&gt;={{CT:8}} \\mbox{ and } {{CT:7}}&lt;={{CT:9}}\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "n1", "n2", "p", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}